load @term/seed/algebra/lie
  find lie-algebra

# A universal enveloping algebra: the associative algebra built from a Lie algebra so that the Lie bracket becomes the
# commutator (a times b minus b times a). It is the universal home where a Lie algebra's representations become ordinary
# module actions, the bridge from the infinitesimal symmetry to its linear realizations. The form carries the underlying
# Lie algebra.
form universal-enveloping-algebra
  link algebra, like lie-algebra
